                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iM1MWAiCvncMk1cti"><p>How the Cores Work</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iSF24aLN4vvrfX56d"><p>The heart of the Lio system is the Flavour Core. Each Core contains natural essential oils and plant extracts held in a medical-grade fiber matrix. As you inhale, air flows through the Core and over the aromatics, picking up therapeutic scent that travels directly to your brain&apos;s olfactory region, helping to manage cravings, calm stress, and break unwanted habits.</p></div></div
