                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iwlCc82WNjNpNtn67"><p>What&apos;s in the Cores?</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iDZe3UrWOrdYZDoPw"><p>Our scent cores are made using 100% organic natural essential oils extracted from plants, herbs, and botanicals. These pharmaceutical-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only, like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and natural aromas. In our lab, our team blends science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations. No chemicals, no nicotine, no harmful additives, just natural plant extracts, expertly crafted to support your habit change journey.</p></div></div
